<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK CUTS MORTGAGE RATES FROM MONDAY.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK CUTS MORTGAGE RATES FROM MONDAY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank </p>
<p>said on Friday it would cut its mortgage interest rates on</p>
<p>Monday as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY		    NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>(base rates)</p>
<p>    annually revised	  4.75 pct	4.95 pct</p>
<p>    three-year revisable    4.95 pct	5.95 pct</p>
<p>    five-year revisable     6.00 pct	6.55 pct</p>
<p>    Fixed for 10 years	6.95 pct	7.25 pct</p>
<p>    Fixed for 20 years	7.40 pct	8.20 pct</p>
<p>    &quot;One way KB rate&quot;	 7.90 pct	8.60 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
